{'symbol': 'D', 'date': '2022-07-27 16:25:00', 'title': 'DOMINION ENERGY ANNOUNCES FULL REDEMPTION OF SERIES A CUMULATIVE PERPETUAL CONVERTIBLE PREFERRED STOCK', 'text': 'RICHMOND, VA. , JULY 27, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DOMINION ENERGY, INC. (NYSE: D), ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT WILL REDEEM FOR CASH ALL OUTSTANDING SHARES OF ITS SERIES A CUMULATIVE PERPETUAL CONVERTIBLE PREFERRED STOCK (CUSIP NUMBERS 25746U 810 AND 25746U DN6) (THE SERIES A PREFERRED STOCK) ON SEPT.'}